---
// NOT IMPORTED BY ANYTHING. The footer that renders is `site-footer.astro`,
// from `layouts/Base.astro`, which reads its four groups from copy.yaml. This
// is the v1 footer, kept rather than deleted for the reason given at the top of
// SiteHeader.astro.
//
// Two things were removed from it. The link to `/campaign/method/` is gone:
// that route is a redirect stub under D-26, and a redirect exists to keep an
// old URL working, not to advertise it. The sentence it sat inside claimed
// every number on the site traces to an evidence record, which is a claim about
// gate 5 that belongs where gate 5's result is shown, not under a link.
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-install">
      <code>pip install reward-lens</code>
    </div>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Footer">
      <a href="https://github.com/reward-lens/reward-lens">GitHub</a>
      <a href="https://pypi.org/project/reward-lens/">PyPI</a>
      <a
        href="https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1x5zG07HdsWlNsJmkl2ddJ1yalmwwujfY?usp=sharing"
        >Colab tour</a
      >
      <a href="/log/">Log</a>
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/about/#cite">Cite</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/reward-lens/reward-lens/blob/main/LICENSE"
        >MIT license</a
      >
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: var(--sp-16);
    padding: var(--sp-8) 0 var(--sp-12);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .footer-inner {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--page-pad);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
  }
  .footer-install code {
    background: var(--code-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--r-chip);
    padding: var(--sp-1) var(--sp-2);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }
  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-6);
  }
  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 32px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .footer-links a {
      min-height: 44px;
    }
  }
  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
